 "bloques": [
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Describe discomfort",
   "texto": [
    "**Svimmel** means «dizziness»; **hoven**, «swollen / a». **Utslett** is a skin irritation or rash. To ask if it bites, you can say **Klør det?** («Pica?»)."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Talk about an accident",
   "texto": [
    "**Å falle** means «fall» and its past is irregular: **falt** («I fell / it fell»). To locate a pain, **vondt i kneet** («knee pain») is said; **kne** is neutral and its defined form is **kneet**."
   ]
  },
